@startuml
 title ApexStay ERP — Module 04 System Architecture
 left to right direction
 actor "Inventory Manager / Cashier" as User
 rectangle "React + Vite Frontend\nDashboard • Catalog • POS • Reports" as UI
 rectangle "XianFire / Express API\nRoutes → Controllers → Services" as API
 rectangle "Sequelize ORM" as ORM
 database "MySQL\nApexStay Module 04" as DB
 User --> UI : HTTPS / browser
 UI --> API : JSON REST /api/*
 API --> ORM : model operations
 ORM --> DB : mysql2 / SQL
 rectangle "Other ApexStay Modules\n(Integration boundary)" as Other
 Other ..> API : future shared API contracts
@enduml
